{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12242090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12242090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1224209001:0":{"text":"もうやめて！あんたたちの尻ぬぐいなんて私は御免よ！","source_cn":"都住手！我不是来替你们收拾烂摊子的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25575DEFAAE1AF24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224209002:0":{"text":"作業員の皆さん、聞いて。ブラッディ・マリーは埠頭の独占なんかしない。ラスティーアンカーにかつての栄光を取り戻したいだけよ！","source_cn":"码头上的工人都听好了：血薇帮不会独占码头，我们当家的是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0C2080963DEC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1224209003:0":{"text":"ただ数人の現場監督を派遣してることも、あんたたちが埠頭に頼って生活してるのを考慮してのことでしょ！","source_cn":"我们只派了几个工头，是有考虑到你们还要靠码头吃饭的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE498ECA519B83E92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224209004:0":{"text":"そして感謝するどころか工事の妨害！開港したくないの？永遠に閉鎖されたままでいいの！？","source_cn":"你们不领情，还在这里阻碍施工！怎么，不想港口开放，就想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4F0261748E512F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224209005:0":{"text":"黙れ！","source_cn":"——净说没用的屁话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF45F96B5A752B329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224209006:0":{"text":"そもそもラスティーアンカーをこんなあり様にしたのは、お前らブラッディ・マリーだろうが！封鎖を命じたのも、今更再建とかほざいてるのも、全部お前らじゃないか！","source_cn":"锈锚港现在这德行，不都归功于你们血薇帮吗！当初下令封锁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802CBD3D6BF1BD5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224209007:0":{"text":"そうだそうだ！あんたたちはきれいごとばかり並べて、汗水たらす俺たちの話など聞こうともしない！","source_cn":"就是这个理！你们永远有理，我们一帮只知道卖力气的大老粗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B23B125D1C0C8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224209008:0":{"text":"もしお前らがいなかったら、俺はとっくに船で海に出てた。そして大儲けして、家族全員で幸せな生活を送ってたかもな！","source_cn":"要不是你们，我的家人兄弟就能跟着船队出海，说不定还能做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7E7029FF408BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224209009:0":{"text":"この野蛮人め……\n貿易を行うことは、浜辺で貝殻を拾うのとは訳が違うんだぞ！","source_cn":"你这个野蛮人……\\n真当出海贸易和下海捞贝壳一样简单？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x310A0DB6721BF4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224209010:0":{"text":"これまでどれだけの船が海に出たきり、ラスティーアンカーに戻らなかったか……それに、死海の艦隊（モルティア）も海上で悪事を働いていた！奴らの手に落ちた人々がどうなるか知っているか！？","source_cn":"多少船只没有返航，多少人没命回到锈锚港……更别提之前还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF9C166BEADC62FA","variant_status":"","male":"","fem